Description: oneq node and relay together (server install)
 Installs the oneq node (oneqnode) and the oneq relay (oneqrelay: registry, user
 accounts, relay and STUN service) in one step, at the same version.
 .
 Install oneqnode alone on a machine that only joins a mesh; oneqrelay alone on
 a machine that only serves one.
